{"v":15,"id":"e17","kid":"emma","title":"An Email to My Host Family","zh":"给寄宿家庭的一封邮件","level":"A2","genre":"实用文 · 邮件","src":"original","sum":"王欣暑假要去西雅图住在约翰逊家。她在邮件里介绍自己，询问要带什么、家里的作息和照顾猫的注意事项，并说明自己对花生过敏。","words":304,"paras":[{"t":"From: Wang Xin","w":[[0,4,"From",-1],[6,10,"Wang",0],[11,14,"Xin",0]]},{"t":"To: The Johnson Family","w":[[0,2,"To",-1],[4,7,"the",1],[8,15,"Johnson",1],[16,22,"family",1]]},{"t":"Subject: Hello from your new student!","w":[[0,7,"Subject",-1],[9,14,"hello",-1],[15,19,"from",-1],[20,24,"your",-1],[25,28,"new",-1],[29,36,"student",-1]]},{"t":"Dear Mr. and Mrs. Johnson,","w":[[0,4,"Dear",-1],[5,8,"Mr",2],[9,12,"and",2],[13,17,"Mrs",2],[18,25,"Johnson",2]]},{"t":"My name is Wang Xin, and I am the student from Suzhou, China, who will stay with you this summer. I am very excited to meet you, and I would like to tell you a little about myself.","w":[[0,2,"my",-1],[3,7,"name",-1],[8,10,"is",-1],[11,15,"Wang",0],[16,19,"Xin",0],[21,24,"and",-1],[25,26,"i",-1],[27,29,"am",-1],[30,33,"the",-1],[34,41,"student",-1],[42,46,"from",-1],[47,53,"Suzhou",-1],[55,60,"china",-1],[62,65,"who",-1],[66,70,"will",-1],[71,75,"stay",-1],[76,80,"with",-1],[81,84,"you",-1],[85,89,"this",-1],[90,96,"summer",-1],[98,99,"i",-1],[100,102,"am",-1],[103,107,"very",-1],[108,115,"excited",-1],[116,118,"to",-1],[119,123,"meet",-1],[124,127,"you",-1],[129,132,"and",-1],[133,134,"i",-1],[135,140,"would",3],[141,145,"like",3],[146,148,"to",3],[149,153,"tell",-1],[154,157,"you",-1],[158,159,"a",-1],[160,166,"little",-1],[167,172,"about",-1],[173,179,"myself",-1]]},{"t":"I am thirteen years old and in Grade 7. I live with my parents and my grandfather in an apartment near a big lake. My favorite subjects are science and art. In my free time, I like drawing comics, swimming and playing table tennis. I am not very good at cooking yet, but I can make tomato and egg noodles. Maybe I can cook them for you one day!","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,4,"am",-1],[5,13,"thirteen",-1],[14,19,"years",-1],[20,23,"old",-1],[24,27,"and",-1],[28,30,"in",-1],[31,36,"Grade",4],[40,41,"i",-1],[42,46,"live",-1],[47,51,"with",-1],[52,54,"my",-1],[55,62,"parents",-1],[63,66,"and",-1],[67,69,"my",-1],[70,81,"grandfather",-1],[82,84,"in",-1],[85,87,"an",-1],[88,97,"apartment",-1],[98,102,"near",-1],[103,104,"a",-1],[105,108,"big",-1],[109,113,"lake",-1],[115,117,"my",-1],[118,126,"favorite",-1],[127,135,"subjects",-1],[136,139,"are",-1],[140,147,"science",-1],[148,151,"and",-1],[152,155,"art",-1],[157,159,"in",-1],[160,162,"my",-1],[163,167,"free",5],[168,172,"time",5],[174,175,"i",-1],[176,180,"like",-1],[181,188,"drawing",-1],[189,195,"comics",-1],[197,205,"swimming",-1],[206,209,"and",-1],[210,217,"playing",-1],[218,223,"table",6],[224,230,"tennis",6],[232,233,"i",-1],[234,236,"am",-1],[237,240,"not",-1],[241,245,"very",-1],[246,250,"good",7],[251,253,"at",7],[254,261,"cooking",-1],[262,265,"yet",-1],[267,270,"but",-1],[271,272,"i",-1],[273,276,"can",-1],[277,281,"make",-1],[282,288,"tomato",8],[289,292,"and",8],[293,296,"egg",8],[297,304,"noodles",8],[306,311,"maybe",-1],[312,313,"i",-1],[314,317,"can",-1],[318,322,"cook",-1],[323,327,"them",-1],[328,331,"for",-1],[332,335,"you",-1],[336,339,"one",9],[340,343,"day",9]]},{"t":"The program says that I will arrive at Seattle airport on July 6 in the afternoon, and that someone from the program will take me to your house. Is that right?","w":[[0,3,"the",-1],[4,11,"program",-1],[12,16,"says",-1],[17,21,"that",-1],[22,23,"i",-1],[24,28,"will",-1],[29,35,"arrive",-1],[36,38,"at",-1],[39,46,"Seattle",-1],[47,54,"airport",-1],[55,57,"on",-1],[58,62,"july",-1],[65,67,"in",-1],[68,71,"the",-1],[72,81,"afternoon",-1],[83,86,"and",-1],[87,91,"that",-1],[92,99,"someone",-1],[100,104,"from",-1],[105,108,"the",-1],[109,116,"program",-1],[117,121,"will",-1],[122,126,"take",-1],[127,129,"me",-1],[130,132,"to",-1],[133,137,"your",-1],[138,143,"house",-1],[145,147,"is",-1],[148,152,"that",-1],[153,158,"right",-1]]},{"t":"I have a few questions. First, should I bring anything special, like a towel or a raincoat? I heard that it rains a lot in Seattle. Second, what time do you usually have breakfast and dinner? I want to follow your family's routine. Third, the program says you have a cat. I love cats, but I have never had a pet. Is there anything I should know about taking care of her?","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,6,"have",-1],[7,8,"a",10],[9,12,"few",10],[13,22,"questions",-1],[24,29,"first",-1],[31,37,"should",-1],[38,39,"i",-1],[40,45,"bring",-1],[46,54,"anything",-1],[55,62,"special",-1],[64,68,"like#2",-1],[69,70,"a",-1],[71,76,"towel",-1],[77,79,"or",-1],[80,81,"a",-1],[82,90,"raincoat",-1],[92,93,"i",-1],[94,99,"heard",-1],[100,104,"that",-1],[105,107,"it",-1],[108,113,"rains",-1],[114,115,"a",18],[116,119,"lot",18],[120,122,"in",-1],[123,130,"Seattle",-1],[132,138,"second",-1],[140,144,"what",-1],[145,149,"time",-1],[150,152,"do",-1],[153,156,"you",-1],[157,164,"usually",-1],[165,169,"have",-1],[170,179,"breakfast",-1],[180,183,"and",-1],[184,190,"dinner",-1],[192,193,"i",-1],[194,198,"want",-1],[199,201,"to",-1],[202,208,"follow",-1],[209,213,"your",-1],[214,222,"family's",-1],[223,230,"routine",-1],[232,237,"third",-1],[239,242,"the",-1],[243,250,"program",-1],[251,255,"says",-1],[256,259,"you",-1],[260,264,"have",-1],[265,266,"a",-1],[267,270,"cat",-1],[272,273,"i",-1],[274,278,"love",-1],[279,283,"cats",-1],[285,288,"but",-1],[289,290,"i",-1],[291,295,"have",-1],[296,301,"never",-1],[302,305,"had",-1],[306,307,"a",-1],[308,311,"pet",-1],[313,315,"is",-1],[316,321,"there",-1],[322,330,"anything",-1],[331,332,"i",-1],[333,339,"should",-1],[340,344,"know",-1],[345,350,"about",-1],[351,357,"taking",11],[358,362,"care",11],[363,365,"of",11],[366,369,"her",-1]]},{"t":"One more thing: I am allergic to peanuts, so I cannot eat peanuts or any food that contains them. I am sorry for any trouble.","w":[[0,3,"one",13],[4,8,"more",13],[9,14,"thing",13],[16,17,"i",-1],[18,20,"am",-1],[21,29,"allergic",12],[30,32,